---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "One of One · Browser Fingerprint Lab"
	: "万中无一 · ONE OF ONE";
const description = isEn
	? "One of One: An interactive browser fingerprint uniqueness lab exploring cookie-less identity tracking. Measure your local Canvas, WebGL, AudioContext, font metrics, and hardware entropy in real time."
	: "万中无一 · ONE OF ONE：浏览器指纹唯一性交互实验室。在后 Cookie 时代，探索由 Canvas、WebGL、音频上下文、字体度量与硬件参数构成的无感跨站追踪机制，实时测量你的浏览器信息熵。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div id="one-of-one-root" class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#070b12] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-cyan-500/30 selection:text-cyan-200">
			<!-- Ambient Laboratory Glow -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#06b6d4_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-80 h-80 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- 1. HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>FINGERPRINT LAB · ENTROPY ANALYSIS</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>🔍</span>
							<span>CLIENT-SIDE HARDWARE & RENDER SIGNALS</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">2026-10-12 · 启发自无 Cookie 追踪深度研讨</span>
						<span class="lang-en">2026-10-12 · Inspired by Modern Tracking Discussions</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">万中无一 · ONE OF ONE</span>
					<span class="lang-en">One of One · Browser Fingerprint Lab</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">无需 Cookie，无需授权：你的设备硬件正悄无声息地出卖你的唯一身份。</span>
					<span class="lang-en">No cookies, no prompts: your hardware and render stack silently betray your uniqueness.</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							随着各大浏览器逐步废弃第三方 Cookie，跨站广告网络并未就此失灵。相反，基于 JavaScript 的浏览器指纹技术（Browser Fingerprinting）已成为事实上的追踪替代品。通过执行数行静默的渲染指令与硬件探针，脚本能在数十毫秒内收集数十个微观维度的技术特征——从显卡着色器的微小舍入误差，到字体光栅化引擎的次像素抗锯齿曲线。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							As browsers phase out third-party cookies, cross-site trackers have not conceded defeat. Instead, passive browser fingerprinting has become the premier identification mechanism. By executing quiet client-side render instructions and hardware queries, tracking scripts extract dozens of microscopic traits in tens of milliseconds—ranging from GPU floating-point rounding quirks to subpixel font rasterization differences.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							每一项特征单独看似平淡无奇，但当它们在信息论的交叉笛卡尔积中交织时，候选人群便会经历断崖式指数缩减。本实验室带您在完全隔离的环境下直击指纹生成的全过程，度量您当下的信息熵值。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Each individual signal appears benign on its own. Yet when combined under information theory, the candidate pool undergoes a precipitous exponential collapse. This lab lets you observe the fingerprinting process firsthand in strict local isolation, measuring your current bits of entropy.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Big Privacy Notice Banner -->
				<div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-start sm:items-center gap-3">
					<span class="text-2xl flex-shrink-0">🛡️</span>
					<div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-300">
						<span class="font-bold">
							<span class="lang-zh">零网络上报承诺：</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Strict Zero-Network Promise:</span>
						</span>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							本页面所有扫描、渲染、音频合成与哈希计算均在您本地浏览器中即时运行。没有任何数据包会被发送至任何服务器或外部分析平台。您可以完全离线或审查网络面板验证。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							All canvas drawing, WebGL rendering, audio tone synthesis, and hashing occur entirely inside your local browser. Zero bytes leave your machine. You can inspect the Network tab or run this completely offline.
						</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 2. LIVE FINGERPRINT SCANNER & HERO READOUT -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400 mb-1">
							<span>🔬</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">即时指纹采样与哈希</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Real-Time Sample & Hash</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">指纹核心读数 · The Identity Card</span>
							<span class="lang-en">The Identity Card · Fingerprint Readout</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<button
							id="btn-rescan"
							type="button"
							class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-cyan-600 hover:bg-cyan-500 active:scale-95 transition-all text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold shadow-lg shadow-cyan-900/30 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
						>
							<span id="rescan-spinner" class="inline-block transition-transform">🔄</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">重新采样 (Re-Scan)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Re-Scan Surface</span>
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Identity Card Grid -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
					<!-- Primary Fingerprint Badge -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-2 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
						<div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-40 h-40 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

						<div>
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
								<span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
									<span class="lang-zh">SHA-256 复合硬件指纹</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Composite SHA-256 Digest</span>
								</span>
								<span id="scan-status-pill" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/40">
									<span class="lang-zh">扫描完毕</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Scanned</span>
								</span>
							</div>

							<!-- Big Hash Display -->
							<div class="my-3">
								<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1 font-mono">
									<span class="lang-zh">截断摘要 (前 16 位十六进制)</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Truncated Digest (First 16 Hex Characters)</span>
								</div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
									<span id="fingerprint-hash" class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-mono font-black text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-300 via-teal-200 to-indigo-300 tracking-wider">
										----------------
									</span>
									<button
										id="btn-copy-hash"
										type="button"
										class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-mono border border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
										title="Copy SHA-256"
									>
										<span class="lang-zh" id="copy-text-zh">复制完整哈希</span>
										<span class="lang-en" id="copy-text-en">Copy Full Hash</span>
									</button>
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Deterministic Nickname -->
							<div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80">
								<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono mb-1">
									<span class="lang-zh">根据哈希字节确定的浏览器动物别名：</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Deterministic Browser Persona (from hash bytes):</span>
								</div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
									<span class="text-3xl" id="nickname-emoji">🐾</span>
									<div>
										<div id="nickname-title" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide">
											<span class="lang-zh">计算中...</span>
											<span class="lang-en">Computing...</span>
										</div>
										<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
											<span class="lang-zh">无论刷新多少次，只要硬件与环境不变，您就是这只专属动物。</span>
											<span class="lang-en">Stable across refreshes unless hardware or render engine changes.</span>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/60">
							<span id="scan-time-label">Scan time: ~15ms</span>
							<span id="scan-count-label">Scanned once</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Entropy Summary Card -->
					<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
						<div>
							<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">
								<span class="lang-zh">总体信息熵估值</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Total Entropy Estimate</span>
							</div>

							<div class="mb-4">
								<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-0.5">
									<span class="lang-zh">有效相关性折扣熵</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Effective Discounted Entropy</span>
								</div>
								<div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-mono font-black text-emerald-400 flex items-baseline gap-1">
									<span id="effective-entropy-bits">~27.5</span>
									<span class="text-base font-normal text-slate-400">bits</span>
								</div>
								<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
									<span class="lang-zh">（扣除时区与语言等强耦合特征后的真实区分度）</span>
									<span class="lang-en">(Real-world discriminative power after correlation discount)</span>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800/80 mb-4">
								<div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase mb-1">
									<span class="lang-zh">人群唯一性估算 (1 in 2^N)</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Uniqueness Ratio (1 in 2^N)</span>
								</div>
								<div id="uniqueness-ratio" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-mono font-black text-white">
									1 in ~190,000,000
								</div>
								<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-normal">
									<span class="lang-zh">在当前互联网活跃设备池中，平均每 1.9 亿台机器才会偶遇一台与你具有完全相同渲染特征的设备。</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Only 1 machine in ~190 million shares identical rendering characteristics with yours.</span>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
								<div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-slate-800/60">
									<span class="lang-zh">理论独立累加和:</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Naive Independent Sum:</span>
									<span id="naive-entropy-sum" class="text-slate-200">~45.5 bits</span>
								</div>
								<div class="flex justify-between py-1">
									<span class="lang-zh">全球网民总数所需比特:</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Bits for Earth Population:</span>
									<span class="text-amber-400">~33.0 bits (8.5B)</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
							<span class="lang-zh">基于 EFF Panopticlick 与 Cover Your Tracks 经验模型</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Empirical baseline: EFF Panopticlick / Cover Your Tracks</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 3. ENTROPY BREAKDOWN TABLE -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 mb-1">
							<span>📊</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">逐项度量与特征细分</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Attribute-by-Attribute Breakdown</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">特征信息熵拆解表 · Entropy Matrix</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Entropy Breakdown Matrix</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
						<span class="lang-zh">参考值基于 EFF 实测经验数据标定</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Calibrated against published EFF empirical data</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						下表展示了从您浏览器提取的各项实测指标、对应的采样值、以及该维度能为追踪系统贡献的信息量（以香农信息量比特 bits 计）。条形图代表其在 12 比特标尺下的相对分辨力。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						The table below details each measured browser attribute, the extracted sample from your machine, and the estimated information entropy it contributes (measured in Shannon bits). The horizontal bar indicates relative uniqueness on a 12-bit scale.
					</span>
				</p>

				<!-- Responsive Table Container -->
				<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 shadow-lg">
					<table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs sm:text-sm">
						<thead>
							<tr class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider">
								<th class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold">
									<span class="lang-zh">探针维度 / 属性</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Attribute / Signal</span>
								</th>
								<th class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold">
									<span class="lang-zh">从当前浏览器实测读取的特征</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Extracted Local Value</span>
								</th>
								<th class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-right">
									<span class="lang-zh">预估熵 (Bits)</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Est. Entropy</span>
								</th>
								<th class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold w-40 sm:w-56">
									<span class="lang-zh">相对信息量</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Relative Weight</span>
								</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody id="entropy-table-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-800/60 font-sans">
							<!-- Rows injected and updated by JS, with SSR fallbacks for instant render -->
							<tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors" data-signal="canvas">
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-200">
									<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
										<span class="text-cyan-400">🎨</span>
										<div>
											<div class="font-bold text-white">
												<span class="lang-zh">Canvas 2D 文本与图形</span>
												<span class="lang-en">Canvas 2D Text & Geometry</span>
											</div>
											<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">
												<span class="lang-zh">GPU 次像素抗锯齿与贝塞尔渲染微瑕</span>
												<span class="lang-en">Subpixel antialiasing & curve raster quirks</span>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 max-w-xs break-all">
									<span id="val-canvas" class="text-cyan-300">Measuring...</span>
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono font-bold text-right text-emerald-400 whitespace-nowrap">
									~9.5 bits
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4">
									<div class="w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full h-2.5 overflow-hidden">
										<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-emerald-400 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 79%;"></div>
									</div>
								</td>
							</tr>

							<tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors" data-signal="webgl">
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-200">
									<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
										<span class="text-indigo-400">🎮</span>
										<div>
											<div class="font-bold text-white">
												<span class="lang-zh">WebGL 渲染器与着色器</span>
												<span class="lang-en">WebGL Renderer & Shaders</span>
											</div>
											<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">
												<span class="lang-zh">未遮盖显卡型号、着色器精度与三角光栅</span>
												<span class="lang-en">Unmasked GPU model, extensions, triangle raster</span>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 max-w-xs break-all">
									<span id="val-webgl" class="text-indigo-300">Measuring...</span>
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono font-bold text-right text-emerald-400 whitespace-nowrap">
									~8.2 bits
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4">
									<div class="w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full h-2.5 overflow-hidden">
										<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-indigo-400 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 68%;"></div>
									</div>
								</td>
							</tr>

							<tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors" data-signal="audio">
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-200">
									<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
										<span class="text-amber-400">🔊</span>
										<div>
											<div class="font-bold text-white">
												<span class="lang-zh">音频上下文 (AudioContext)</span>
												<span class="lang-en">OfflineAudioContext Waveform</span>
											</div>
											<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">
												<span class="lang-zh">动态压缩器处理三角波的浮点误差频响</span>
												<span class="lang-en">Dynamics compressor floating-point curve</span>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 max-w-xs break-all">
									<span id="val-audio" class="text-amber-300">Measuring...</span>
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono font-bold text-right text-emerald-400 whitespace-nowrap">
									~6.0 bits
								</td>
								<td class="py-3 px-4">
									<div class="w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full h-2.5 overflow-hidden">
										<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-amber-400 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 50%;"></div>
									</div>
								</td>
							</tr>

							<tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors" data-signal="fonts">
								<td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-200">
									<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
										<span class="text-pink-400">🔤</span>
										<div>
											<div class="font-bold text-white">
												<span class="lang-zh">系统字体探测 (Canvas 度量)</span>
												<span class="lang-en">System Font Fingerprinting</span>
											</div>
